<title>JAPAN: Daiwa Motor Trans - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Motor Trans - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.89		vs		11.40</p>
<p> Operating   loss 219 million	 vs	prft 259 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 380 million	 vs	prft 137 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 329 million	 vs	 prft 14 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 31.34 yen	  vs	  prft 1.38 yen</p>
<p> Shares		11 million	 vs		11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs		 2.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daiwa Motor Transportaion Co Ltd operates taxis and hire car service.</p>
